  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Full Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A transfer-proof, nude lip liner that balances precision and color payoff with glide and blendability for a soft-matte finish with all-day wear.<b><br><br>Formulation Type: </b>Lip Liner<br><br><b>Benefits: </b>Long-wearing<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Comfort-Wear Technology (Vitamin E, Ceramides, Jojoba Oil): Amplifies formula’s instant color release, lightweight feel, and long-wear performance.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> In nude shades matched to real lip tones, this lip pencil effortlessly shapes and enhances with pigmented, blendable color and all-day wear. Enriched with vitamin E, ceramides, and jojoba oil plus comfort-wear technology, this</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply to clean, dry lips. Wear alone or layer with any lip product. <br>-Customize your look: Outline with a deeper shade to define, overline for fullness, blend edges inward for a soft contour, or use a brighter shade to add dimension.<br></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Comfort-Wear Technology (Vitamin E, Ceramides, Jojoba Oil): Amplifies formula&rsquo;s instant color release, lightweight feel, and long-wear performance.<br><br>C9-12 Alkane, Bis-Behenyl/Isostearyl/Phytosteryl Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Mica, Sucrose Tetrastearate Triacetate, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Synthetic Wax, Cera Carnauba (Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Cire de Carnauba), Polyglyceryl-4 Diisostearate/Polyhydroxystearate/Sebacate, Ceramide NP, Tocopherol, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Isopropyl Titanium Triisostearate, Propylene Carbonate.  May Contain +/-: CI 77491/77492/77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 15850 (Red 7), CI 15850 (Red 7 Lake), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 15850 (Red 6), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake), CI 77742 (Manganese Violet), CI 42090 (Blue 1 Lake).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
